{
 "voice": "af_heart",
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Seventy-four soldiers knocked down an iron bridge just by walking across it.",
   "start": 0.2,
   "end": 4.189,
   "slot": [
    0.2,
    4.25
   ],
   "speed": 1.246,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "It's eighteen thirty-one, and the brand new bridge over the river is the pride of the whole town.",
   "start": 4.55,
   "end": 9.243,
   "slot": [
    4.55,
    9.3
   ],
   "speed": 1.189,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The men are marching home four across, every boot hitting the planks at the exact same moment.",
   "start": 9.6,
   "end": 14.699,
   "slot": [
    9.6,
    14.7
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Halfway over, the bridge starts bouncing under their feet.",
   "start": 14.95,
   "end": 17.574,
   "slot": [
    14.95,
    17.6
   ],
   "speed": 1.206,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "A normal person would slow down,",
   "start": 17.7,
   "end": 19.343,
   "slot": [
    17.7,
    19.35
   ],
   "speed": 1.23,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "but these guys think it's hilarious.",
   "start": 19.45,
   "end": 21.242,
   "slot": [
    19.45,
    21.38
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody starts whistling a marching tune,",
   "start": 21.55,
   "end": 23.534,
   "slot": [
    21.55,
    23.55
   ],
   "speed": 1.267,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "and the whole column stomps along to it, a little harder every step.",
   "start": 23.65,
   "end": 27.149,
   "slot": [
    23.65,
    27.35
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The bounce gets bigger, the chains start groaning,",
   "start": 27.55,
   "end": 29.918,
   "slot": [
    27.55,
    29.95
   ],
   "speed": 1.188,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "and nobody wants to be the one who breaks step.",
   "start": 30.15,
   "end": 32.433,
   "slot": [
    30.15,
    32.8
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Then,",
   "start": 33.0,
   "end": 33.597,
   "slot": [
    33.0,
    33.6
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "a single bolt snaps,",
   "start": 33.733,
   "end": 34.8,
   "slot": [
    33.7,
    34.8
   ],
   "speed": 1.32,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "and the whole end of the bridge drops into the river.",
   "start": 34.95,
   "end": 37.361,
   "slot": [
    34.95,
    37.65
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Luckily, the river was only two feet deep.",
   "start": 38.0,
   "end": 40.197,
   "slot": [
    38.0,
    40.25
   ],
   "speed": 1.107,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Unluckily, the river was only two feet deep.",
   "start": 40.55,
   "end": 42.939,
   "slot": [
    40.55,
    43.3
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, every bridge has a rhythm it naturally likes to sway at.",
   "start": 43.6,
   "end": 46.885,
   "slot": [
    43.6,
    46.9
   ],
   "speed": 1.114,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Ever pushed a kid on a swing?",
   "start": 47.15,
   "end": 48.622,
   "slot": [
    47.15,
    48.65
   ],
   "speed": 1.08,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Each push is tiny, but if they all land at just the right moment, the swing goes higher and higher.",
   "start": 48.85,
   "end": 53.778,
   "slot": [
    48.85,
    53.9
   ],
   "speed": 1.222,
   "overrun": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-four men stepping together were pushing that bridge like a swing.",
